Test Steps:
3. Curl with multimodal requests:
curl http://<model-serving-ip-address>:41091/v1/chat/completions -XPOST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
    "model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B",
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Describe the image."
          },
          {
            "type": "image_url",
            "image_url": {
              "url": "http://farm6.staticflickr.com/5268/5602445367_3504763978_z.jpg"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "max_tokens": 512
  }'

3. Curl with pure language requests:
curl http://<model-serving-ip-address>:41091/v1/chat/completions -XPOST -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
    "model": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B",
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "What is Deep Learning?"
      }
    ],
    "max_tokens": 512
  }'

2. Send POST request to the /v1/summary endpoint:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
    "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "SIMPLE",
    "processor_kwargs": {"process_fps": 1}
  }'

2. Send POST request to the /v1/summary endpoint, enable configured levels:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "SIMPLE",
    "processor_kwargs": {"levels": 4, "level_sizes": [1,6,8,-1]}
  }'

2. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint, enable both VLM and LLM with temporal enhancement:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "USE_ALL_T-1",
    "processor_kwargs":{"process_fps": 1}
  }'

3. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint, , enable only VLM with temporal enhancement:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "USE_VLM_T-1",
    "processor_kwargs":{"process_fps": 1}
  }'

4. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint, enable only LLM with temporal enhancement:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "USE_LLM_T-1",
    "processor_kwargs":{"process_fps": 1}
  }'

2. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint, choose video chunking method as `uniform`:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "USE_ALL_T-1",
    "processor_kwargs":{"process_fps": 1, "chunking_method": "uniform"}
  }'

3. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint, choose video chunking method as `pelt`:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "method": "USE_ALL_T-1",
    "processor_kwargs":{"process_fps": 1, "chunking_method": "pelt"}
  }'

2. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
    "video": "/app/video.mp4",
    "method": "SIMPLE",
    "processor_kwargs": {"process_fps": 1}
  }'

2. Send POST request to /summarize endpoint, enable configured levels:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{                                                                                                       "video": "https://test_1hour.mp4",
    "method": "SIMPLE",
    "processor_kwargs": {"levels": 4, "level_sizes": [1,6,8,-1]}
  }'

2. Send POST request to /v1/summary selecting the Chinese task:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/summary -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
    "video": "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5992517/5992517-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4",
    "task": "summary_zh",
    "method": "SIMPLE",
    "processor_kwargs": {"process_fps": 1}
  }'

1. Send POST request in autogen mode:
curl http://localhost:8192/v1/tasks -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{
    "task_name": "scene_watch",
    "mode": "autogen",
    "description": "Detect unsafe playground behavior for toddlers."
  }'

